// greenroom.yarn

title: greenroomStart
//setting: greenroom with Gray & Bolton, 2nd death
---
<<set $greenroom_active = true>>
Bolton: Alright Gibbs, do your thing.

You: On it.

<<showZPrompt()>>
// doesn't need to be "dialogue" it can be something popping up covering the screen like a giant Z button
===

title: greenroomWakeUp
//setting: greenroom, gibbs awake
---
<<set $greenroom_woke_up = true>>
// NEEDS DIALOGUE: greenroom wakeup sequence
===

title: greenroomInteractSaxophone
//setting: greenroom with Gray & Bolton, 2nd death
---
<<if $is_asleep>>
    <<if $greenroom_saxophone_collected == false>>
        You: Looks like it was dented, possibly the murder weapon?

        You: I should snag a photo of the *dent* for ballistics.

        <<collectEvidence("greenroomSaxophone")>>
        <<set $greenroom_saxophone_collected = true>>
        <<set $greenroom_evidence = $greenroom_evidence + 1>>
        <<writeToNotepad greenroomSaxophone "Saxophone" "Saxophone has a dent in it that appears consistent with bludgeoning. Was it grabbed out of convenience? Suggests it was closest to the victim maybe?">>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===

title: greenroomInteractSaxophonePlayer
//setting: greenroom with Gray & Bolton, 2nd death
---
<<if $is_asleep>>
    <<if $greenroom_saxophoneplayer_collected == false>>
        You: Looks like he's intentionally pointing outward... towards the vent.

        You: I should take a photo of his *mouth* - where he got hit.

        <<collectEvidence("greenroomSaxophonePlayer")>>
        <<set $greenroom_saxophoneplayer_collected = true>>
        <<set $greenroom_evidence = $greenroom_evidence + 1>>
        <<writeToNotepad greenroomSaxophonePlayer "The Victim" "Looks like their mouth was hit by something blunt. Their body position is interesting? Looks like they're reaching towards the vent.">>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===

title: greenroomInteractIceBucket
//setting: greenroom with Gray & Bolton, 2nd death
---
//<<if $is_asleep>>
    //<<if $greenroom_icebucket_observed == false>>
        You: The ice still hasn't melted, this is incredibly fresh kill.

        You: All the people with recent access to this room would be top suspects.

        <<set $greenroom_icebucket_observed = true>>
        <<set $greenroom_evidence = $greenroom_evidence + 1>>
        <<writeToNotepad greenroomIceBucket "Ice Bucket" "Ice has barely began to melt, this must've just happened. Likely suspects are anyone that had access to this room in the past hour.">>
    //<<endif>>
//<<endif>>
===

title: greenroomInteractVent
//setting: greenroom with Gray & Bolton, 2nd death
---
<<if $is_asleep>>
    <<if $greenroom_vent_collected == false>>
        You: Something's in this vent...

        You pry in from under the vent

        You: Keys?

        You: Let me lift these for prints.

        <<collectEvidence("greenroomVent")>>
        <<set $greenroom_vent_collected = true>>
        <<set $greenroom_evidence = $greenroom_evidence + 1>>
        <<writeToNotepad greenroomVent "Hidden Keys" "Keys were deliberately put out of reach of the victim, but the door was locked when we got here. I suspect the killer had a pair of keys of their own to lock the door.">>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===

title: greenroomInteractInstruments
//setting: greenroom with Gray & Bolton, 2nd death
---
<<if $is_asleep>>
    <<if $greenroom_instruments_collected == false>>
        You: All three of these instruments can give insight on who was in this room.

        You: I'll lift all their prints in one go.

        <<collectEvidence("greenroomInstruments")>>
        <<set $greenroom_instruments_collected = true>>
        <<set $greenroom_evidence = $greenroom_evidence + 1>>
        <<writeToNotepad greenroomInstruments "Matching Musicians" "My hunch is this was done by a fellow musician, I think it's best to have all their fingerprints at our disposal.">>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===